  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can turn a fall to your advantage.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ki Stand<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Standing up as a swift action no longer provokes an attack of opportunity. Spending a ki point allows you to move up to 5 feet as part of this action. You may instead spend a use of mythic power to move up to half your speed as part of this action. This movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
